{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Bandhura","html":"<article id='thag1.103'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.103 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.103 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekādasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Eleven </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Bandhurattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Bandhura </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Nāhaṁ etena atthiko, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I have no need of this—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sukhito dhammarasena tappito; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’m happy and satisfied with the sweet teaching. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Pitvā rasaggamuttamaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ve drunk the best, the supreme nectar: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Na ca kāhāmi visena santhavan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I won’t go near poison. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Bandhuro thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
